<Group SymbolName="TransmitSRDO1MapParameters"><Parameter SymbolName="NumberOfMappingEntries" Index="0x1381" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="254" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Number of Mapped Applications Objects in SRDO, including nomarl and invert entries. <br/>
        Given value should be even. <br/>
        Changing the map is only possible in state CO_PRE_OPERATIONAL. <br/>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Mapping" Index="0x1381" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        <p>Mapping for the n:th Application Object to be Mapped.</p>
        <p> subindex n  : Application object with normal data. </p>
        <p> subindex n+1: Application object with invert data. </p>
        <p>Example: 2001h:2 (16-bit variable) gives value=20010210h
           where index=2001h subindex=2h datatype=10h (->U16).</p>
        <p>Changing the map is only possible in state CO_PRE_OPERATIONAL.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

