        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CobIdPDORx" Index="0x1403" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
