<Group SymbolName="ReceivePDO1MapParameters"><Parameter SymbolName="NumberOfObjects" Index="0x1600" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Number of Mapped Applications Objects in PDOnRx.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Mapping" Index="0x1600" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        <p>Mapping for the n:th Application Object to be Mapped.</p>
        <p>Example: 2001h:2 (16-bit variable) gives value=20010210h
           where index=2001h subindex=2h datatype=10h (->U16).</p>
        <p>When a PDO is disabled it is possible to set new values in the its map, The number of parameter
        can be changed by writing the required number in the LastSubIndex field.</p>
        <p>Changing the map is only possible in state CO_PRE_OPERATIONAL.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ReceivePDO2MapParameters"><Parameter SymbolName="NumberOfObjects" Index="0x1601" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
