        It is necessary to store the parameters to EEPROM and restart the node for the new CobID to be effective.</p>
        <p>Changing this value is only possible in state CO_PRE_OPERATIONAL.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="TransTypePDOTx" Index="0x1801" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="1" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        <ul>
         <li>1-240: Transmit data after the n:th SYNC.</li>
         <li>254: Transmit data immediately after receiving PDOnrx.</li>
         <li>255: Transmit data when the event timer times out.</li>
        </ul>
        <p> PDOnTx is by default only transmitted if PDOnRx is used. <br/>
