       Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MaxReverseAccelerationSet0" Index="0x2102" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" Factor="1" Unit="Rpm/2ms/SpeedChangeFactor (see Description)"><Description><![CDATA[
       
