          Read and write U32 at the specificed memory address.
        
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="AnalogInput1"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x2300" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
