<Group SymbolName="ErrorLogCopy"><Description><![CDATA[
      
       <div>
       This logger consists of the following objects <a href="#ErrorLog">ErrorLogCopy</a>,
       <a href="#ErrorLogFirstTime">ErrorLogFirstTime</a>,
       <a href="#ErrorLogLastTime">ErrorLogLastTime</a> and
       <a href="#ErrorLogNumberOfErrors">ErrorLogNumberOfErrors</a>. As the logger actually consist of multiple object,
       in order to read the content of these objects, a synchronized update must be performed.
       This is performed by once reading the LastSubIndex on any of the objects.
       Note that there is a copy of <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy</a> at <a href="#ErrorLog">ErrorLog</a>.
       </div>
       
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3002" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual errors that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the error log (and event log).</p>
       <p>Subindex 0 must be read before any other subindex is read. Reading any other subindex before reading subindex
        will result in corrupt information since the error list is not generated before Subindex 0 is read.  </p>
        <p>Read this subindex only once before traversing the Indices related to the ErrorLog. DO NOT read this subindex during the traversal
        as this will regenerate the sorted list presented via these Indices. If an error occurs during the traversal an inconsistent view will
        result. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CanOpenErrorLog" Index="0x3002" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>In this log the Emergency Error code is stored. See <a href="#ErrorLogFirstTime">ErrorLogFirstTime, ErrorFirstTime</a> and
       <a href="#ErrorLogLastTime">ErrorLogLastTime, ErrorLastTime</a> for more information about the time of error.</p>
       <p>Newest error is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 errors are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>Subindex 0 in this Index must be read before any other subindex is read. Reading any other subindex before reading subindex
        will result in corrupt information since error list is not generated before Subindex 0 is read.
       </p>
       <p> If an event is configured as a warning and to be stored in the error log, there might be warnings in the error log. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ErrorLogFirstTime"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3003" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual errors that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the error log (and event log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ErrorFirstTime" Index="0x3003" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="See Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest error is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list. Time is related to TotalTime250ms.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 errors are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>250ms per tick.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       <p> If an event is configured as a warning and to be stored in the error log, there might be warnings in the error log. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ErrorLogLastTime"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3004" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual errors that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the error log (and event log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ErrorLastTime" Index="0x3004" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="See Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest error is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list. Time is related to TotalTime250ms.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 errors are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>250ms per tick.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       <p> If an event is configured as a warning and to be stored in the error log, there might be warnings in the error log. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ErrorLogNumberOfErrors"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3005" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual errors that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the error log (and event log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ErrorNrOfErrors" Index="0x3005" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="incs"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest error is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 errors are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#ErrorLogCopy">ErrorLogCopy.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       <p> If an event is configured as a warning and to be stored in the error log, there might be warnings in the error log. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EventLog"><Description><![CDATA[
      
       <div>
       This logger consists of the following objects <a href="#EventLog">EventLog</a>,
       <a href="#EventLogFirstTime">EventLogFirstTime</a>,
       <a href="#EventLogLastTime">EventLogLastTime</a> and
       <a href="#EventLogNumberOfEvents">EventLogNumberOfEvents</a>. As the logger actually consist of multiple object,
       in order to read the content of these objects, a synchronized update must be performed.
       This is performed by once reading the LastSubIndex on any of the objects.
       </div>
       
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3006" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual events that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the event log (and the error log).</p>
       <p>Subindex 0 must be read before any other subindex is read as it generates the sorted view of the events currently in the log.
       Reading any other subindex before reading subindex will result in corrupt information since error list is not generated before Subindex 0 is read. </p>
       <p>Read this subindex only once before traversing the Indices related to the EventLog. DO NOT read this subindex during the traversal
        as this will regenerate the sorted list presented via these Indices. If an event occurs during the traversal an inconsistent view will
        result.</p>
        </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CanOpenEventLog" Index="0x3006" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>In this log the Event Id is stored. See <a href="#EventLogFirstTime">EventLogFirstTime, FirstTime</a> and
       <a href="#EventLogLastTime">EventLogLastTime, LastTime</a> for more information about the time of event.</p>
       <p>Newest event is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 events are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>Subindex 0 must be read before any other subindex is read. Reading any other subindex before reading subindex
        will result in corrupt information since error list is not generated before Subindex 0 is read. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EventLogFirstTime"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3007" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual events that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the event log (and the error log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FirstTime" Index="0x3007" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="See Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest event is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list. Time is related to TotalTime250ms.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 events are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>250ms per tick.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EventLogLastTime"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3008" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual events that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the event log (and the error log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="LastTime" Index="0x3008" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="See Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest event is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list. Time is related to TotalTime250ms.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 events are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>250ms per tick.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EventLogNumberOfEvents"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3009" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The entry at sub-index 0 contains the number of actual events that are recorded starting at subindex 1.</p>
       <p>Writing a zero to sub-index 0 clears the event log (and the error log).</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NrOfEvents" Index="0x3009" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="incs"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Newest event is stored at sub-index 1, the older ones move down the list.</p>
       <p>Up to 20 events are stored in the log.</p>
       <p>See <a href="#EventLog">EventLog.LastSubIndex</a> for correct procedure to read Error Log.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EventLogMasterClear" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Parameter SymbolName="MasterClear" Index="0x300A" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>The Log Eeprom area is cleared, independent of current event status, by writing Zero to this object. It is not allowed to clear event log while enabled.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="Diagnostic"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ExtendedWarnings" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     See Appendix A Error Handling.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ExtendedErrors" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     See Appendix A Error Handling.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="EventCounter" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="incs"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     This counter increase with one on every new event. It can be used in
     Transient recorder to see exact when an event occurs, which might make it
     easier to understand the plot results.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="TrigEvent" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     Write the Event number in this object to test it. This can be used to force
     an event. Only one Event can be forced at the time. When writing 0 (or an
     other event number) it will restore the previous state of the event. Was it
     in EVENT_STATE_PENDING it will return to EVENT_STATE_PENDING.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SequenceNumber" Index="0x3010" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     Increased by One each time a change in ActiveEventList occurs.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ActiveEvents"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x3011" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="20" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     Number of active events. By reading, ActiveEvents are updated with a copy of a 50Hz scheduled list (i.e. max 20ms delay).
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ActiveEvents" Index="0x3011" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="20" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Currently active events (maximum 20 events, not in time order). To update this list the LastSubIndex for this object must be read. <br>
       An event that is configured to trip the drive will be latched and can only be cleared from list by toggling Enable Power Stage-bit on->off (<a href="#ApplicationCommands">ApplicationCommands, CommandAll)</a>.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="TransmitActiveEvents"><Parameter SymbolName="TransmitActiveEvents" Index="0x3012" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="1" DefaultValue="0" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     Force node to transmit emcy message for all active events.<br>
     Simply write '1' to force the transmit.<br>
     Note that the value will be set to '0' immediately, but does not mean it's not transmitting.<br><br>
     When finished a custom emcy message will be transmitted with all data bytes set to '0'.<br><br>
    <table id="ET">
    	<tr id="ETHead"> <th>Value</th>  <th>Description</th></tr>
    	<tr id="ETRow">  <td>0</td> <td id="ETData"><RemoveModifiers>Not activated.</RemoveModifiers></td></tr>
    	<tr id="ETRow">  <td>1</td> <td id="ETData"><RemoveModifiers>Transmitting emcy messages for active events.</RemoveModifiers></td></tr>
    </table><br/>
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="SystemReactionBitField"><Parameter SymbolName="SystemReactionBitField" Index="0x3013" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
      Aggregated system reaction bit field for all active events</br></br>
     
    ]]></Description><BitFieldDefs>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="0" Name="STORE_IN_SYSTEM_LOG_BIT" Description="Store in system log"/>
        <!-- Traction related -->
        <BitFieldDef Bit="1" Name="TRACTION_DISABLE_POWER_STAGE_BIT" Description="Traction - Disable Power Stage"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="2" Name="TRACTION_STOP_BIT" Description="Traction - Stop"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="3" Name="TRACTION_LIMP_HOME_MODE_BIT" Description="Traction - Limp Home Mode"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="4" Name="TRACTION_ELECMECHBRAKE_IMMEDIATELY_BIT" Description="Traction - Pull Electromechanical Brake Immediately "/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="5" Name="TRACTION_ELECMECHRAKE_DELAY_BIT" Description="Traction - Pull Electromechanical Brake After Time Delay"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="6" Name="TRACTION_ELECMECHRAKE_SPRVSDSTOP_BIT" Description="Traction - Pull Electromechanical Brake After Supervised Vehicle Stop"/>
        <!-- Hydraulics related -->
        <BitFieldDef Bit="7" Name="HYDRAULIC_DISABLE_POWER_STAGE_BIT" Description="Hydraulics - Disable Pump"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="8" Name="HYDRAULIC_STOP_MAST_BIT" Description="Hydraulics - Disable Mast Functions"/>
        <!-- Others -->
        <BitFieldDef Bit="9" Name="RELEASE_MAIN_CONTACTOR_BIT" Description="Release Main Contactor"/>
        <!-- Reserved -->
        <BitFieldDef Bit="10" Name="RESERVED_1_BIT" Description="Reserved1"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="11" Name="RESERVED_2_BIT" Description="Reserved2"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="12" Name="RESERVED_3_BIT" Description="Reserved3"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="13" Name="RESERVED_4_BIT" Description="Reserved4"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="14" Name="RESERVED_5_BIT" Description="Reserved5"/>
        <BitFieldDef Bit="15" Name="RESERVED_6_BIT" Description="Reserved6"/>
    </BitFieldDefs></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EmcyManufacturerErrorSpecificFieldType"><Parameter SymbolName="ManufacturerSpecificErrorField" Index="0x3014" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="OEM" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="1" DefaultValue="0" Unit=""><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Select the type of content that will be included in the manufacturer error field in an emcy message.<br><br>
        <table id="ET">
          <tr id="ETHead"> <th>Index</th>  <th>Type</th></tr>
          <tr id="ETRow">  <td>1U</td> <td id="ETData"><RemoveModifiers>EventId + System Reaction</RemoveModifiers></td></tr>
          <tr id="ETRow">  <td>0U</td> <td id="ETData"><RemoveModifiers>Error Bit-Field</RemoveModifiers></td></tr>
        </table><br/>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="CurrentSensorsCalibration" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Iu" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Instantaneous current in phase U.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Iv" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Instantaneous current in phase V.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Iw" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Instantaneous current in phase W.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SetDefaultValues" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="wo" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Writing value 1 to this index sets the default values.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IvGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="2500*10" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at 25degC</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       <b>If not calibrated, write the default value to clear default value events.<b/>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IvPosTempGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at maximum 85degC.</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IvNegTempGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at minimum -40degC.</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IwGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="2500*10" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at 25degC</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       <b>If not calibrated, write the default value to clear default value events.<b/>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IwPosTempGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="12" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at maximum 85degC.</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IwNegTempGain" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="13" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p>Calibration done at minimum -40degC.</p>
       <p>A*10/(AD-range/2)</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IvOffset" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="14" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Current measurement offset in phase V.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IwOffset" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="15" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-32768" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Current measurement offset in phase w.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ZeroSequenceCurrent" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="20" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Zero sequence current calculated as the sum of all three phases.
       This should be 0 in a balanced system.
       On products with two measured phase currents, this will always be 0.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Ialpha" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="22" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Instantaneous current in alpha direction.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Ibeta" Index="0x4000" SubIndex="23" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="INTEGER16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-3276" MaximumValue="3276" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="Apk"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Instantaneous current in beta direction.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="AverageExecutionTimes" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Description><![CDATA[
    
    <div id="GrDescCoBkg">Array of thread execution times (windowed average).</div>
    
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Statemachine" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[4 kHz and 500 Hz threads]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="50Hz" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[Background thread running in 50 Hz]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IndependentSupervision" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CAN" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SlowApplication" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[User application slow context]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FastApplication" Index="0x4100" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[User application fast context]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="MaxExecutionTimes" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Description><![CDATA[
    
    <div id="GrDescCoBkg">Array of maximum thread execution times.</div>
    
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Statemachine" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[4 kHz and 500 Hz threads]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="50Hz" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[Background thread running in 50 Hz]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="IndependentSupervision" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CAN" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SlowApplication" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[User application slow context]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FastApplication" Index="0x4101" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="us"><Description><![CDATA[User application fast context]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="RTOS" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="WatchDogTest" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       If writing 1 the internal watchdog is no longer kicked at. This is only for testing the internal watchdog.</br>
       If writing 2 the control flow monitoring for FLASH CRC and I/O-register signature is inhibited.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ResetsSincePowerOn" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="incs"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of CPU resets.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="InternalDebugModuleName" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="" MaximumValue=""><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Module Name.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="InternalDebugLineNumber" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Line Number.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="InternalDebugCount" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Count.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootInternalDebugModuleName" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="" MaximumValue=""><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Module Name in Boot part.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootInternalDebugLineNumber" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Line Number in Boot part.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootInternalDebugCount" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Internal Debug Count in Boot part.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FLASHControlFlowMask" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="14" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Flowcontrol bit mask for FLASH CRC checks.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FlashApplCRC" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="18" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Last calculated CRC of Application part of FLASH-memory.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FlashBootCRC" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="19" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Last calculated CRC of Boot part of FLASH-memory.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FlashLoopCounter" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="20" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of FLASH CRC loops performed.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CRCTime" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="21" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of system ticks to calculate CRC32 for the FLASH memory and
       signature areas.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ReadBackConfigState" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="23" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="6" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        State for the Readback Configuration checks.
        
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="0" Description="Initial state, no checking is performed"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="IO Lock done, calculating reference signature"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="IO Lock done, calculating and checking signature"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="3" Description="Fail in signature detected"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="4" Description="Sleep mode, no checking of signature"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ReadBackConfigSignature" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="24" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="0xffffffff" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        Last calculated Readback Configuration Signature.
        
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ReadBackConfigStored" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="25" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="0xffffffff" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        Stored value in EEPROM of last calculated Readback Configuration Signature.
        
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ReadBackConfigValidStore" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="26" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="1" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        Valid flag for stored value in EEPROM of last calculated Readback Configuration Signature.
        
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ParamConfigState" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="27" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="6" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        State for the Parameter areas check.
        
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="0" Description="First state, no calculations are done"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="Initial state, calculation of reference signature"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="Running state, calculating and checking signature"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="3" Description="Fail in signature detected"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ParamConfigSignature" Index="0x4102" SubIndex="28" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="0xffffffff" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
        
        Last calculated Parameter areas Signature.
        
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="StatemachineSlotTimes" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4103" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of threads.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="StatemachineSlotMaxExecTimes" Index="0x4103" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Keep track of which states generated max time in us for the state machine 500 Hz slots.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="McuGpioPinStatus" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Description><![CDATA[
    
    <div id="GrDescCoBkg">
    Pin status on the GPIO ports of the MCU. The state is shown regardless if the pin is an input or an output.
    It shows the unfiltered state of the pins at the instant this OD access is served.
    The pins may toggle serveral times between the readings without being reflected by this method.
    </div>
    
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="7" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOA" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOB" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOC" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOD" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOE" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOF" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="GPIOG" Index="0x4104" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="LowlevelCan"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NoOfRxSubscribers" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The total number of internal subscribers of Rx CAN-messages. (Both CAN1 and CAN2 subscribers).
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NoOfUsedFilterBlocks" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The total number of used filter blocks in CAN-interfaces. (Both CAN1 and CAN2 subscribers).
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NoOfAvailableFilterBlocks" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The total number of filterblocks implemented in hardware. (Both CAN1 and CAN2 subscribers).
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NoOfTxTransmitters" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The total number of internal registered CAN-transmitters. (Both CAN1 and CAN2 subscribers).
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CanConfigStatus" Index="0x410D" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
    
    CAN and Node configuration status.<br/>
    
    ]]></Description><BitFieldDefs>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="0" Name="CheckFailed" Description="Was not able to cross check config between MCU1 and MCU2 at cold boot/power on. Both MCUs will starts its applications if valid."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="1" Name="CANBitRateConflict" Description="MCU1 and MCU2 have different bitrates. MCU2 has changed its bitrate to MCU2 setting. MCU2 will stay in boot mode."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="5" Name="CANTalkNodeIdConflict" Description="MCU1 and MCU2 have same ID on CAN for CANTalk configured. MCU2 has incremented its ID. MCU2 will stay in boot mode."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="6" Name="UDSNodeIdConflict" Description="MCU1 and MCU2 have same address on CAN for UDS configured. MCU2 has incremented its address. MCU2 will stay in boot mode."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="7" Name="CANopenNodeIdConflict" Description="MCU1 and MCU2 have same ID on CAN for CANopen configured. MCU2 has incremented its ID. MCU2 will stay in boot mode."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="24" Name="MCU2Dummy" Description="MCU2 is in Dummy Mode. CAN is normally off"/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="25" Name="MCU2CanOnWhenDummy" Description="MCU2 CAN is turned on when MCU2 is in Dummy Mode"/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="26" Name="MCU2CanOff" Description="MCU2 CAN is turned off"/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="28" Name="MCU2Sensor2PullUp" Description="Sensor 2 inputs are pulled up by MCU2 when in Dummy Mode."/>
     <BitFieldDef Bit="31" Name="CheckPerformed" Description="CAN configuration cross check has been performed at last cold boot/power on."/>
    </BitFieldDefs></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="CanBus1Status"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ReceiveErrorCounter" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     CAN1 error counter according to protocol. <br/>
     When the counter exceeds 127, the CAN1 controller enters passive state.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="TransmitErrorCounter" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     CAN1 error counter according to protocol. <br/>
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MaxReceiveErrorCounter" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The maximum value detected of ReceiveErrorCounter from the time of the last reset. <br/>
     This value can be reset by writing any value to it.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MaxTransmitErrorCounter" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The maximum value detected of TransmitErrorCounter from the time of the last reset. <br/>
     This value can be reset by writing any value to it.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MaxNoOfSoftwareFilterBlocks" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="28" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The number of available software filter blocks in CAN1 interface.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NoOfUsedSoftwareFilterBlocks" Index="0x4110" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="-" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
     
     The number of used software filter blocks in CAN1 interface.
     
    ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="Password"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <div id="GrDescCoBkg">Enter password to enable writing to indexes with password protection. Reading
        an index returns a random number used for calculating the password that shall be entered.
        <p>Note!<br/>
          Additional pw1 and pw2 open the protection for each other as well.
          Pw6 opens for all parameters.
        </p>
       </div>
       
    ]]></Description><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of password levels.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelService1" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[Clearing of the error log and the time counters, access to calibration parameters]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelService2" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[Clearing of the error log and the time counters, access to calibration parameters]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelOem" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[Setup parameters that has to be handled with care]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelNotUsed1" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelNotUsed2" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description/></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelInternal" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[Internal parameters mainly for development purpose]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PasswordLevelAll" Index="0x4200" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[All parameters are accessible]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="EvsCANopenObjectDictionaryInfo"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F00" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="RevisionNumber" Index="0x5F00" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Subversion revision number of the Inmotion EVS CANopen Object Dictionary Specification.<br/>
       See "http://sthsv11/svn/vehicle/common_standards_and_specifications/trunk/EVS CANopen object dictionary specification.doc".
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="SwDeviceInformation"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootSwNameAndArticleNumber" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1.<br/>
        E.g. "SW Boot 30MIPS 69Y20001A08".
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootSwBuildTime" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Not supported.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BootSwCheckSum" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Not supported.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwArticleNumber" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="&quot;69NUS423C00x04&quot;" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1.<br/>
        E.g. "69Y05483C04".<br/>
        <i>Note:</i> This entry exists both at <a href="#ManufacturerSoftwareVersion">0x100A</a>
        and <a href="#SwDeviceInformation.ApplicationSwArticleNumber">SwDeviceInformation.ApplicationSwArticleNumber</a>.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwBuildTime" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of seconds since 1970-01-01.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwCheckSum" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       CRC32 checksum of SW, stored last in flash.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwBuildDate" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Date generated by compiler at compile time.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwSvnRevision" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="224510" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Subversion revision. Data generated by compiler at compile time.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationSwSvnModifiedFiles" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       No of modified files in current Subversion revision. Data generated by compiler at compile time.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CustomerSpecificHexNumber" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Customer Specific Number as Hex.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CustomerSpecificDecNumber" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Customer Specific Number as Decimal.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CustomerSpecificString" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="12" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NotUsed" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Customer Specific String.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SoftwareApplicationNumber" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="13" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="423" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Application number.<br/>
       e.g. 69Y05***C07, where *** is the application number.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SoftwareMajorVersion" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="14" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Application software major version.<br/>
       e.g. 69Y05002C**x01, where ** is the software major revision.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SoftwareMinorVersion" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="15" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="4" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Application software minor version.<br/>
       e.g. 69Y05002C01x**, where ** is the software minor revision.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationPlasmaLabel" Index="0x5F01" SubIndex="17" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="PLASMA_3_7_004_00_RC" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1.<br/>
        E.g. "PLASMA_4_0_021_01_WIP".<br/>
        Contains the ORIGINAL_PLASMA_LABEL for this build.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="HwDeviceInformation"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="HwFileUsed" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="&quot;80N22503AB02&quot;" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       The name of the HW file used. E.g. "80Y05599CD04". Stored in flash.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MCUFamily" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="&quot;STM32&quot;" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       String defined by Inmotion to identify the MCU Family.<br/>
       Possible values: "STM32"
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MCUUniqueId" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Unique MCU ID. 96-bits in hexadecimal ascii-string.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MCUDeviceTypeId" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       MCU Device (Type) Id. 12-bit. For F10x medium-density devices, the device ID is 0x410. For F2xx, the device ID is 0x411.
       See DBGMCU_IDCODE in MCU reference manual for further details.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MCURevisionId" Index="0x5F02" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       MCU Revision. 16-bit. See DBGMCU_IDCODE in MCU reference manual for further details.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="WorkingHours"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F03" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="TotalTimeHours" Index="0x5F03" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="h"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Total time in hours that KEY voltage is on and not in sleep or standby mode.
        Writing to this sub-index clears/sets the Total Time (i.e. TotalTime250ms, TotalTimeSeconds and TotalTimeHours).<br/>
        <br/>
        <i>Note:</i> This entry is duplicated on both
        <a href="#WorkingHours.TotalTimeHours">WorkingHours.TotalTimeHours</a> and
        <a href="#OperationTime.TotalTimeHours">OperationTime.TotalTimeHours</a>.
       
     ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="CANParameters"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="Bitrate" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="125" MaximumValue="1000" DefaultValue="500" Factor="1" Unit="kbit/s"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       125, 250, 400, 500 and 1000 kbit/s
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SyncTimeout" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="8000" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="ms"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Setting the time to zero means:
        <UL>
        <LI> No sync timeouts will be generated </LI>
        <LI> Tx PDOs with transmission type 1-240 will be sent periodicaly when in CO_OPERATIONAL </LI>
        </UL>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NodeId" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="1" MaximumValue="31" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p> NodeId used to calculate COB-id for SDO1 and PDO1-4.</p>
       <p>A change of CANopen Node Id is not effective until after a reset.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CanOpenState" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="7" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="0" Description="Init"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="Pre operational"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="Stopped"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="3" Description="Sleep"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="4" Description="Standby"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="5" Description="Exit sleep"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="6" Description="Exit standby"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="7" Description="Operational"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NodeIdCanTalk" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="1" MaximumValue="31" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p> NodeId used to calculate COB-id for CANTalk. </p>
       <p> Normally same Id as NodeId used to calculate SDO1 and PDOs COB Id's. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NodeIdSDO2" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="127" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p> NodeId used to calculate COB-id for SDO2.</p>
       <p> SDO2 is nonstandard but used when to allow two SDO masters to communicate
       with one drive. Normally SDO2 COB Id = SDO1 COB Id + 32. </p>
       <p> Set to 0 to turn off SDO2. </p>
       <p>A change of CANopen Node Id is not effective until after a reset.</p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SdoTimeout" Index="0x5F04" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="8000" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="ms"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       <p> Sdo Timeout is used when no PDOs are active.</p>
       <p> If an Sdo timeout occurs when the drive will disable itself. </p>
       <p> Set to 0 to turn off timeout. </p>
       <p> Reset of unit is required to take effect. </p>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="RxPdoTimeouts"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F05" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="32" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="PdoTimeout" Index="0x5F05" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="ARRAY" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Service" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="8000" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="ms"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Setting the time to zero means no timeout.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ProductInformation"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="EnableWrite" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="wo" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="-" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
        
       Write key value to enable update of one of the ItemInformation strings/bit fields. Written in production.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemSerialNumber" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       Item serial number, e.g., "2621970-003". Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemSerialNumber once. Written in production. Max 15 characters long.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemType" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NoValue" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       Item type, e.g., "ACS48M55-Y35T". Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemType once. Written in production. Max 17 characters long.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemNumber" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NoValue" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       Item number, e.g., "83N21945B-0002". Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemNumber once. Written in production. Max 17 characters long.<br/>
       <i>Note:</i> This entry exists both at <a href="#ManufacturerHardwareVersion">0x1009</a>
       and <a href="#ProductInformation.ItemNumber">ProductInformation.ItemNumber</a>.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemProductionDate" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="see Description"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of seconds since 1970-01-01. Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemProductionDate once. Written in production.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemStatus" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NoValue" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       Item status, e.g, "C1" for C-sample status. Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemStatus once. Written in production. Max 3 characters long.
        <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
         and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ItemMaxCurrent" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="32767" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="ARMS"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Max allowed current for item, e.g., "380" for 380 ARMS (see also <a href="#ApplicationSwInformation.HwDetectedMaxCurrent">ApplicationSwInformation, HwDetectedMaxCurrent</a>).
       Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ItemMaxCurrent once. Written in production.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1422) and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="CustomerItemNumber" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NoValue" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of CustomerItemNumber once. Written in production. Max 15 characters long. <BR/>
       Reading value "*" indicates that the length of the string that should have been written in production exceeded max size (i.e. 15 characters). <BR/>
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ControlBoardItemNumber" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="VISIBLE_STRING" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="NoValue" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       "ASCII" according to ISO 8859-1. <BR/>
       The name of the control board, e.g., "80N21502AB01". Written in production. Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of ControlBoardItemNumber once.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MaxNominalDcVoltage" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED16" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="65535" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="Vdc"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Max allowed nominal DC voltage for item, e.g., "48" for 48V. Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of MaxNominalDcVoltage. Written in production.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="HardwareConfiguration" Index="0x5F10" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Internal" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="4294967295" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Bit field for different hardware configurations, e.g, OVP or HVL. Write key values to EnableWrite to enable update of HardwareConfiguration. Written in production.
       <b>Parameter has its own checksum. At checksumerror, event is set (See event id 1421 that also is used for other product information parameters)
        and default value will be set. </b>
       
      ]]></Description><BitFieldDefs>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="0" Name="OVP" Description="Hardware is configured with OVP"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="1" Name="HVL" Description="Hardware is configured with HVL"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="2" Name="DC_POWERSTAGE" Description="Hardware has DC (P-) power stage"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="3" Name="DualUse" Description="Hardware support above 599Hz operation"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="4" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="5" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="6" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="7" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="8" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="9" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="10" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="11" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="12" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="13" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="14" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="15" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="16" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="17" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="18" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="19" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="20" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="21" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="22" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="23" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="24" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="25" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="26" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="27" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="28" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="29" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="30" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
       <BitFieldDef Bit="31" Name="NotUsed" Description="-"/>
      </BitFieldDefs></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="SWInterfaceData" WarningRemark="Internal Use Only"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="InterfaceVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="1" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="6" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of this interface table.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="AutotuningVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="2" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="1" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of Autotuning interface.<br>
       0 means no autotuning interface.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="BPCVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="3" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="1" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of BPC interface.<br>
       0 means no BPC interface.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="OperationLogs" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="4" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="2" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of OperationLogs.<br>
       0 means no operation logs exist.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="TransientRecorder" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="2" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of TransientRecorder.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NumberOfRxPDOs" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="4" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of supported Rx PDOs.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="NumberOfTxPDOs" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="4" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Number of supported Tx PDOs.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="MasterFuncVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of Master Functionality.<br>
       '0' means no Master Functionality is enabled.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="FastTxPDO" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="9" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="1" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Shows if FastTxPDOs are supported.<br>
       <ul>
        <li>0: FastTxPDO is not supported.</li>
        <li>1: FastTXPDO is supported.</li>
       </ul>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="DynamicPDOSize" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="10" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="1" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Shows if unit sends TxPDOs with dynamic size.</br>
       <ul>
        <li>0: Dynamic TxPDOs not used.</li>
        <li>1: Dynamic TXPDOs used.</li>
       </ul>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="SafeRTOSVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="11" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Version of SafeRTOS used or 0x00000000 if SafeRTOS is not present.<br>
       <ul>
         <li>Bit 16-23: Major SafeRTOS version.</li>
         <li>Bit 8-15: Minor SafeRTOS version.</li>
         <li>Bit 0-7: Local SafeRTOS variant.</li>
       </ul>
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="DiagnosticEventManagerVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="12" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Not supported in plasma3.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="DiagnosticTroubleCodeLoggerVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="13" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Not supported in plasma3.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="EventRecorderVersion" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="14" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Service" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="-" MaximumValue="-" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Not supported in plasma3.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ApplicationTestFlags" Index="0x5F30" SubIndex="15" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED32" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="0xffffffff" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
       Bitmask indicating which special buildflags that were used during the build.<br/>
       Not all bits/flags are supported on this version of Plasma.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter></Group>

<Group SymbolName="ConfigurationManager"><Parameter SymbolName="LastSubIndex" Index="0x5F31" SubIndex="0" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="255" DefaultValue="0" Factor="1" Unit="-"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Numbers of entries.
       
      ]]></Description></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="RequestedMotorType" Index="0x5F31" SubIndex="5" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="1" MaximumValue="2" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Requested motor type. New configuration takes effect after restarting.  <br/>
        0 (NOT_AVAILABLE) is currently not allowed to set. <br/>
       
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
      <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="IM"/>
      <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="PM"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ActualMotorType" Index="0x5F31" SubIndex="6" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="2" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Actual Motor type used.
       
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="0" Description="NOT_AVAILABLE"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="IM"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="PM"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="RequestedSensorType" Index="0x5F31" SubIndex="7" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="rw" MinimumValue="1" MaximumValue="6" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Configure sensor type. New configuration takes effect after restarting. <br/>
        0 (NOT_AVAILABLE) is currently not allowed to set. <br/>
       
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="INCR_ENCODER"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="INCR_ENCODER_WITH_Z_PULSE"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="3" Description="SIXSTEP"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="4" Description="HALL"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="6" Description="PWM"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter><Parameter SymbolName="ActualSensorType" Index="0x5F31" SubIndex="8" ObjectType="VAR" DataType="UNSIGNED8" Visibility="Operator" AccessType="ro" MinimumValue="0" MaximumValue="6" DefaultValue="0"><Description><![CDATA[
       
        Actual sensor type used.
       
      ]]></Description><ValueFieldDefs>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="0" Description="NOT_AVAILABLE"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="1" Description="INCR_ENCODER"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="2" Description="INCR_ENCODER_WITH_Z_PULSE"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="3" Description="SIXSTEP"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="4" Description="HALL"/>
        <ValueFieldDef Value="6" Description="PWM"/>
      </ValueFieldDefs></Parameter></Group>

</Parameters>
  </Dictionary>
  <ReplaceList>
