        <Event Name="Sdo1Timeout" EventId="1206u" CheckIn4Khz="FALSE" StoreInLog="TRUE" StoreFreezeFrame="FALSE">
   <Description><![CDATA[
    
     <b>Description</b><br/>
     Event is set if no SDO messages has been received within the timeout time on SDO1.<br/>
     The error detection is started after the first message is received.<br/>
     This event is evaluated in an application with no PDOs active.
     The drive will be disabled on timeout and can not be reenabled.<br/>
     <b>When is event evaluated</b><br/>
     Always<br/>
     <b>Related parameters</b><br/>
     <a href="#CANParameters">CANParameters, SdoTimeout</a><br/>
    
   ]]></Description>
