        <Event Name="SinCosSensorNotConnected" EventId="1608u" CheckIn4Khz="FALSE" StoreInLog="TRUE" StoreFreezeFrame="TRUE">
      <Description><![CDATA[
        
         <b>Description</b><br/>
         Check that unit circle is constant. Will detect one broken signal even if sensor is not rotating. <br/>
         The equation x^2 + y^2 = 1 should always be valid for a SinCosSensor.<br/>
         <b>When is event evaluated</b><br/>
         When <a href="#FeedbackSensor.FeedbackMode">FeedbackMode</a> is 0.<br/>
         <b>Related parameters</b><br/>
